      "path": "/books/fadail-al-shia:45:1",
      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/25/1/42/1",
      "text": [
        ": أتى رسول الله صلّى الله عليه وآله رجل، فقال: يا رسول الله، إنّي لاحبّك. فقال: إنّك لتحبّني؟ فقال: والله إنّي لاحبّك. فقال رسول الله صلّى الله عليه وآله : أنت مع من أحببت."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.badr-shahin": [
          "(The same previous series of relaters)… from al-Hasan bin Ali from Ali bin Aqaba from Musa an-Numayri that Abu Abdullah (a) said: A man came to the Prophet (s) and said: \"O Allah’s Messenger, I do like you.\" He (s) asked: \"Do you really like me?\" The man said: \"By Allah I swear, I love you.\" The Prophet (s) said: \"You will be with whomever you like.\""
        ]
      }
